{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeTT3Ft1ramESJNaC6n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9004\n\nFollowing the discount approval procedure:\n\n## Step 1: Request\n- **Request ID:** DR-9004\n- **Customer:** Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- **Product:** NS-500\n- **Requested discount:** 15.0% ($37,500 on $250,000 list price)\n- **Date:** 2025-09-23\n- **Requestor:** Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- **Basis:** Contract exception (cites \"Acme Master Supply Agreement\")\n\n## Step 2: Customer\nAcme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) = Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730). Same customer.\n\n## Step 3: Product\nSKU NS-500, list price $250,000.\n\n## Step 4: Active contract\nYes. **ACME-MFG-2025** is in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, active on 2025-09-23.\n\n## Step 5: Pricing exception\n**EXC-ACME-NS500-15** is in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31 and covers NS-500 for Acme Manufacturing, permitting a maximum discount of **15%**. It is active on the request date. (It supersedes EXC-ACME-NS500-10, which expired 2025-03-31.)\n\nThe requested discount of 15% equals the maximum; commercial eligibility is established.\n\n## Step 6: Policy in effect on request date\n**PRICING-POLICY-2025** (effective 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31).\n\n## Step 7: Requestor's approval authority\nSarah Chen is registered as an **Enterprise Account Executive** (employee record EMP-101, Sales department).\n\nPRICING-POLICY-2025, § 3: \"Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including 15%.\"\n\nThe requested discount of 15% is within her authority limit.\n\n## Step 8: Required approver\nThe discount of 15% falls within Enterprise Account Executive authority. No escalation to VP Sales is required (which would be needed only for discounts greater than 15%).\n\n## Step 9: Decision\n- Commercial eligibility is established: the customer contract and pricing exception permit up to 15% on this product, on this date.\n- The discount is within the requestor's own authority: Sarah Chen, as an Enterprise Account Executive, may approve up to and including 15% under the effective policy.\n- The request relies on special terms (customer contract and pricing exception) and meets all conditions for approval.\n\n**Outcome: APPROVE**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9004\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 pricing exception under ACME-MFG-2025\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2025\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"15%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": \"Enterprise Account Executive\",\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 contract active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 active on request date, maximum 15% on NS-500\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2025 effective 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31; permits Enterprise Account Executives to approve discounts up to and including 15%\",\n    \"Sarah Chen (EMP-101) registered as Enterprise Account Executive\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5923,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5923},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba8a87bc-ba2c-40b8